WEBVTT

01:47.300 --> 01:51.940
[Mystic Nine]
[Adapted from the novel of Kennedy Xu]

01:52.060 --> 01:54.980
[Episode 29]
[This story is purely fictional]

02:32.580 --> 02:35.820
[Li's Residence]

02:45.080 --> 02:45.450
Fifth Master!

02:45.910 --> 02:47.100
Master just told me to invite you over.

02:47.360 --> 02:47.820
Follow me, please.

02:55.280 --> 02:56.570
Master, Fifth Master is here.

02:59.590 --> 03:00.820
You're here, Laogou.

03:02.680 --> 03:03.820
Fifth Master, go ahead.

03:05.000 --> 03:06.010
The Ministry of War has already

03:06.470 --> 03:08.410
planted informants in the Mystic Nine.

03:11.560 --> 03:12.220
Laogou.

03:12.470 --> 03:13.170
You're here.

03:13.870 --> 03:14.570
What a coincidence.

03:14.710 --> 03:15.830
I just told my man to invite you,

03:15.830 --> 03:16.730
and here you are.

03:17.000 --> 03:18.410
Come. Take a seat.

03:19.560 --> 03:19.890
Come.

03:21.630 --> 03:22.010
Take a seat.

03:24.560 --> 03:24.820
Take a seat.

03:25.280 --> 03:25.890
I brought a pot of liquor.

03:27.190 --> 03:28.260
Let's calm our nerves.

03:28.960 --> 03:29.290
Sure.

03:30.190 --> 03:30.820
Let's calm our nerves.

03:31.960 --> 03:32.290
Pour it.

03:36.150 --> 03:37.940
I suppose the Ministry of War spares us now

03:38.960 --> 03:40.570
because they are still looking for an excuse.

03:42.150 --> 03:44.450
They don't want a riot in Changsha

03:44.710 --> 03:45.690
or to antagonize the Mystic Nine.

03:48.030 --> 03:49.130
We are free now.

03:50.000 --> 03:51.100
That's probably because someone

03:51.470 --> 03:52.500
has set a plan in motion.

03:53.310 --> 03:54.290
Who do you think did that?

03:59.190 --> 04:00.500
Xie Jiu or Master Zhang?

04:05.750 --> 04:06.570
Who knows?

04:09.800 --> 04:10.260
Third Master.

04:11.800 --> 04:12.820
What is your next move?

04:15.710 --> 04:16.580
Lay low.

04:17.750 --> 04:18.700
But heed my advice.

04:20.680 --> 04:21.660
At this juncture,

04:22.070 --> 04:23.140
trust

04:23.390 --> 04:24.580
no one.

04:29.000 --> 04:29.370
Come.

04:29.920 --> 04:30.250
Come.

04:30.830 --> 04:31.340
A toast to you.

04:38.390 --> 04:39.140
You'll drink first.

04:41.040 --> 04:41.780
What is the meaning of this?

04:45.310 --> 04:47.540
I fear you have poisoned the liquor.

05:16.430 --> 05:17.900
What are you on about?

05:19.680 --> 05:21.020
Are you already drunk before you drink?

05:23.000 --> 05:24.370
Laogou is our friend.

05:25.270 --> 05:27.170
When I had a labor complication back then,

05:27.950 --> 05:28.700
Laogou

05:28.720 --> 05:29.780
and Xie Jiu were there to help me.

05:30.000 --> 05:30.850
That's how I survived.

05:32.560 --> 05:33.490
I won't forget

05:34.120 --> 05:35.050
this kindness from you.

05:37.750 --> 05:39.170
You two have known each other for many years.

05:40.560 --> 05:41.460
You can

05:41.560 --> 05:42.610
overcome this obstacle

05:43.390 --> 05:44.410
and live well.

05:45.800 --> 05:46.540
Trust me.

05:47.390 --> 05:49.730
Stay alive, and you'll find a way out.

05:54.800 --> 05:55.140
Yes.

05:57.480 --> 05:59.020
Staying alive is the most important part.

06:02.120 --> 06:02.780
I'm sorry.

06:05.480 --> 06:05.930
Laogou.

06:07.800 --> 06:08.290
Cheers.

06:16.830 --> 06:17.700
Only these two dishes?

06:20.000 --> 06:20.930
Make two more dishes.

06:25.040 --> 06:25.370
Sure.

06:26.070 --> 06:27.020
Two more dishes.

06:28.510 --> 06:29.290
Enjoy

06:29.560 --> 06:30.220
the liquor.

06:42.240 --> 06:42.700
Laogou.

06:46.680 --> 06:47.980
I need a favor from you.

06:48.950 --> 06:49.850
Consider it my debt to you.

06:53.560 --> 06:54.340
Sure, Third Master.

06:58.390 --> 06:59.730
Tonight,

07:01.270 --> 07:01.930
at dusk,

07:03.240 --> 07:04.980
bring my wife and my son with you

07:06.630 --> 07:07.050
and leave.

07:09.070 --> 07:10.370
What are you planning to do?

07:12.430 --> 07:14.980
I'm crippled. I can't run far.

07:15.310 --> 07:17.810
There are enemies within and outside the city.

07:18.630 --> 07:19.900
They want our lives

07:19.920 --> 07:20.930
and the Mystic Nine.

07:21.560 --> 07:22.580
But the woman and the kid

07:22.600 --> 07:23.540
are innocent.

07:27.190 --> 07:28.780
Throughout my life,

07:28.870 --> 07:30.250
I've only trusted my blade, my account ledger,

07:31.680 --> 07:32.660
and you.

07:33.720 --> 07:34.580
Because you

07:34.630 --> 07:35.850
gave my son

07:36.240 --> 07:37.410
his life.

07:41.000 --> 07:41.410
Third Master.

07:42.270 --> 07:43.140
The Ministry of War

07:43.720 --> 07:44.850
spied on me as I came here.

07:45.360 --> 07:46.580
I might die anytime soon.

07:46.870 --> 07:47.810
If I have to take care of your son as well,

07:47.830 --> 07:48.170
isn't that...

07:49.270 --> 07:49.850
But I know

07:49.870 --> 07:51.410
you're not one who runs away from responsibilities.

07:53.630 --> 07:54.580
Besides,

07:54.680 --> 07:56.250
you're my son's godfather.

08:02.560 --> 08:03.290
I'm begging you now.

08:13.870 --> 08:14.540
Who would have thought

08:15.630 --> 08:16.490
that the Third Master

08:18.040 --> 08:19.050
of the Mystic Nine would beg someone one day?

08:29.510 --> 08:30.580
Changsha

08:31.680 --> 08:32.610
isn't what it used to be.

08:35.360 --> 08:36.060
The Mystic Nine

08:37.480 --> 08:39.060
is also not what it used to be.

08:41.080 --> 08:41.610
However,

08:42.510 --> 08:43.940
as long as I live,

08:45.440 --> 08:46.490
you can rest assured

08:48.240 --> 08:49.490
about your wife and your son's safety.

09:14.240 --> 09:15.220
The food is ready!

09:20.670 --> 09:21.770
Li!

09:27.630 --> 09:28.530
Wu Laogou!

09:28.790 --> 09:29.980
You scoundrel!

09:30.390 --> 09:31.580
I'll kill you.

09:34.200 --> 09:36.010
I'll kill you!

09:49.670 --> 09:50.250
Fifth Master.

09:53.390 --> 09:54.130
What is going on?

09:55.120 --> 09:56.100
Why are you covered in blood?

09:57.750 --> 09:58.220
Fifth Master.

10:02.240 --> 10:03.340
What happened?

10:05.080 --> 10:06.250
It's not mine.

10:07.840 --> 10:08.820
It's Chen Pi's,

10:09.720 --> 10:10.610
Heibei's,

10:15.510 --> 10:16.730
and Li's blood.

10:18.870 --> 10:19.770
I

10:21.080 --> 10:22.100
demolished the Mystic Nine.

10:26.790 --> 10:27.490
What?

10:29.270 --> 10:30.010
Xiangu.

10:44.910 --> 10:45.730
It'll be fine.

11:06.500 --> 11:11.380
♪See the moon, indelible as ink♪

11:12.380 --> 11:14.900
♪As red plum blossoms fall along the street♪

11:15.260 --> 11:18.660
♪Who turns back with a troubled frown?♪

11:19.180 --> 11:23.980
♪See the sky lanterns rise and fall♪

11:24.220 --> 11:27.180
♪If I could take one bright thread from memory♪

11:27.620 --> 11:31.900
♪I'd keep its lingering sweetness in my heart♪

11:33.080 --> 11:33.890
Must I

11:33.910 --> 11:34.980
be this cruel?

11:36.240 --> 11:38.060
You need to convince the Ministry of War

11:38.240 --> 11:39.890
that you are driven by self-interest,

11:40.600 --> 11:42.890
and that you take over the Mystic Nine violently.

11:45.260 --> 11:47.540
♪I drink a cup of rough wine♪

11:47.540 --> 11:52.700
♪Right and wrong pass with the changing seasons♪

11:53.100 --> 11:57.100
♪My heart unchanged, I have no regrets♪

11:57.100 --> 12:02.460
♪However the past may have twisted and turned, I regret nothing with you♪

12:03.340 --> 12:09.620
♪When a thousand sails ride wind and waves home, I'll sail with you again♪

12:09.620 --> 12:16.020
♪When flowers fall and you return, I wish time could turn back♪

12:16.380 --> 12:22.220
♪I'll share with you the lingering taste of new wine♪

12:22.820 --> 12:24.660
♪And get drunk with you♪

12:30.480 --> 12:33.050
♪I♪

12:35.130 --> 12:37.500
♪Will turn the Heavenly Palace upside down♪

12:37.500 --> 12:38.780
[Shared Legacy of Mystic Nine]

12:40.360 --> 12:44.230
♪100,000 Heavenly Soldiers♪

12:47.590 --> 12:49.140
I am Wu Laogou.

12:49.590 --> 12:51.100
A dog breeder.

12:51.990 --> 12:52.820
From now on,

12:53.400 --> 12:55.780
[Fifth]
I am the Fifth Master.

12:55.880 --> 13:00.500
♪I am the Monkey King!♪

13:01.760 --> 13:03.890
♪I laugh boisterously♪

13:05.520 --> 13:13.420
♪Open up!♪

14:00.030 --> 14:02.840
- Breaking news! - Breaking news!

14:02.840 --> 14:04.940
- Eryue Hong was badly burnt!
- One newspaper, please.

14:05.240 --> 14:07.610
- Banjie Li was mortally wounded.
- One newspaper.

14:07.720 --> 14:09.530
- Blood has been spilled!
- One newspaper.

14:09.750 --> 14:12.420
- Wu Laogou turned on his own!
- Let me read it.

14:12.670 --> 14:13.820
[Mystic Nine in War]
Young boy, give me one.

14:13.900 --> 14:14.500
[Eryue Hong]

14:14.500 --> 14:15.380
[Laogou]

14:15.380 --> 14:16.220
[Mortally wounded]

14:16.220 --> 14:17.460
[Crippled]

15:07.440 --> 15:08.490
Why did you do that?

15:11.480 --> 15:12.220
Why?

15:19.840 --> 15:20.460
Why?

15:21.840 --> 15:22.340
Master.

15:27.960 --> 15:28.420
Sir.

15:55.480 --> 15:56.250
Huo Wenhai

15:57.120 --> 15:58.420
must have noticed

15:58.720 --> 15:59.770
that we had met the other day.

16:00.150 --> 16:01.340
So he took the risk

16:01.600 --> 16:03.010
[Changsha Defense Headquarters]
and stole the military seal.

16:03.790 --> 16:05.180
He tried to instigate a rebellion.

16:17.200 --> 16:18.650
Fortunately, your perceptive adjutant

16:19.030 --> 16:19.770
picked up the signs

16:20.510 --> 16:21.370
and went in alone

16:21.870 --> 16:23.370
to kill Huo Wenhai.

16:24.390 --> 16:25.100
Unfortunately,

16:25.360 --> 16:26.490
he lost his life to the cause.

16:27.960 --> 16:28.490
That said,

16:29.270 --> 16:30.250
I've written to the higher-ups

16:31.270 --> 16:32.250
and requested that they

16:32.270 --> 16:33.580
give him the title of Army Captain.

16:35.790 --> 16:37.340
He did not care about the title.

16:38.000 --> 16:38.770
I know.

16:40.320 --> 16:41.460
He was not doing this for the title,

16:42.390 --> 16:43.370
but you.

16:46.480 --> 16:47.340
Huo Wenhai

16:47.790 --> 16:48.610
is dead.

16:49.910 --> 16:51.460
That saved us a lot of trouble.

16:54.550 --> 16:56.060
I have already signed the document

16:56.150 --> 16:57.730
appointing you as the special commissioner

16:58.630 --> 16:59.770
to eliminate the Mystic Nine.

17:00.550 --> 17:01.650
It's on your desk.

17:02.870 --> 17:04.770
I've given you the direction.

17:05.550 --> 17:06.700
Qishan, I hope you know

17:07.270 --> 17:07.810
what

17:08.830 --> 17:10.330
to do.

17:12.310 --> 17:15.620
Nevertheless, I don't think the "kill six to save three" plan

17:17.350 --> 17:18.490
will work.

17:24.590 --> 17:25.770
Wu Laogou

17:26.240 --> 17:27.290
took over the Mystic Nine

17:27.680 --> 17:29.050
when it was at its most vulnerable.

17:29.880 --> 17:31.180
He was ruthless

17:31.310 --> 17:32.250
and killed many people.

17:32.830 --> 17:33.900
In the entirety of Changsha,

17:33.920 --> 17:34.530
he is

17:34.750 --> 17:36.090
the biggest underground force.

17:40.310 --> 17:40.860
Read it.

17:42.270 --> 17:43.050
Today's newspaper.

17:47.580 --> 17:48.690
[Breaking News: The Mystic Nine Might be No More]

17:48.690 --> 17:49.790
[Wu Laogou killed everyone in the Mystic Nine]

17:49.790 --> 17:51.220
A thug is a thug.

17:52.200 --> 17:53.810
You can't change his bloodthirsty nature.

17:54.790 --> 17:55.810
We can't spare someone

17:56.110 --> 17:56.810
like Wu Laogou.

17:59.830 --> 18:00.530
I remember

18:01.440 --> 18:02.770
you two have a feud.

18:04.200 --> 18:04.940
Killing him

18:05.270 --> 18:06.620
should be easy for you, right?

18:19.160 --> 18:19.730
Qishan.

18:20.480 --> 18:22.460
Your world is more than just Changsha.

18:23.720 --> 18:24.730
This place is huge,

18:25.350 --> 18:26.940
but it's insignificant in the grand scheme of things.

18:27.640 --> 18:28.770
A war is upon us.

18:30.480 --> 18:31.420
If you do this well,

18:32.720 --> 18:34.460
I'll nominate you to the Ministry of War.

18:35.310 --> 18:35.770
And then,

18:36.790 --> 18:38.250
you'll have a stage to shine.

18:42.440 --> 18:43.770
We've been friends for many years.

18:45.070 --> 18:46.050
I hope

18:47.160 --> 18:48.570
we can fight together in the future.

18:59.200 --> 19:00.220
You have three days.

19:01.310 --> 19:01.900
After three days,

19:02.440 --> 19:03.420
I'll leave Changsha

19:03.720 --> 19:04.860
for Hengyang for a conference.

19:06.590 --> 19:07.420
Zhang Qishan.

19:08.070 --> 19:09.570
Seize this opportunity.

19:10.240 --> 19:11.250
Otherwise,

19:11.830 --> 19:12.460
it'll be

19:13.270 --> 19:14.940
too late for you to regret it.

19:28.180 --> 19:31.140
[Appoint Zhang Qishan as Special Commissioner]

19:43.920 --> 19:44.380
Master.

19:45.440 --> 19:45.860
Fifth...

19:49.480 --> 19:50.010
Wu Laogou

19:51.070 --> 19:52.250
did turn on

19:53.200 --> 19:54.050
the Mystic Nine.

19:56.400 --> 19:58.050
The newspaper described his crime in a few words,

19:59.270 --> 19:59.980
but the reality

20:01.680 --> 20:03.220
is much worse.

20:04.750 --> 20:05.570
Second Master's late wife

20:06.400 --> 20:07.380
was burned.

20:08.720 --> 20:09.770
Third Master was stabbed to death.

20:10.400 --> 20:11.460
Fourth Master was rendered blind.

20:11.640 --> 20:13.050
Sixth Master was cut many times.

20:13.830 --> 20:14.940
No one knows his fate.

20:15.750 --> 20:16.770
Even Miss Huo was...

20:18.070 --> 20:18.810
Even Miss Huo

20:18.830 --> 20:19.570
was not spared.

20:21.350 --> 20:22.420
He removed her spine.

20:23.830 --> 20:25.420
She probably can't walk anymore.

20:27.480 --> 20:28.140
A scheme.

20:30.240 --> 20:31.180
It's all part of his scheme.

20:34.270 --> 20:35.380
Be it Xiaoyu

20:37.070 --> 20:38.050
or Laogou,

20:40.070 --> 20:41.420
they all fell for Xie Jiu's scheme.

20:49.160 --> 20:50.050
Why couldn't anyone

20:50.070 --> 20:51.180
believe me?

20:53.400 --> 20:54.290
I already said

20:55.590 --> 20:57.180
I could save them all

20:59.590 --> 21:01.090
with my life.

21:02.030 --> 21:02.570
Master!

21:03.440 --> 21:03.860
Master,

21:04.070 --> 21:04.900
you know

21:05.640 --> 21:06.810
very well that they believed what you said.

21:07.240 --> 21:08.660
They knew

21:09.200 --> 21:10.770
that you would carry the burden alone,

21:11.640 --> 21:12.330
so they

21:13.590 --> 21:14.810
had to stop you.

21:21.640 --> 21:22.810
Where is Laogou?

21:23.960 --> 21:24.770
In his dog farm, probably.

21:28.350 --> 21:28.860
Get the car ready.

22:04.000 --> 22:05.290
Eighth Master inherited this from his ancestors.

22:06.960 --> 22:08.290
He said it was the only copy left.

22:09.750 --> 22:10.460
He cherished it

22:12.200 --> 22:13.730
more than he cherished his life.

22:29.960 --> 22:30.330
Master.

22:31.160 --> 22:31.620
Master Zhang...

22:32.200 --> 22:33.180
Master Zhang is here.

22:36.240 --> 22:37.140
The inevitable

22:38.590 --> 22:39.570
has arrived.

23:03.240 --> 23:03.810
Move aside.

23:26.680 --> 23:27.220
Laogou.

23:30.160 --> 23:31.250
What are you planning to achieve?

23:39.640 --> 23:40.860
Look who's here.

23:42.920 --> 23:43.810
The head of the Mystic Nine

23:44.880 --> 23:46.330
or the Changsha Defense Commander?

23:47.920 --> 23:49.460
Whatever you plan is,

23:50.790 --> 23:51.380
share it with me.

23:52.270 --> 23:53.220
We work together,

23:54.160 --> 23:55.380
and maybe, we can both get out of this alive.

23:59.640 --> 24:00.700
You promised me

24:01.640 --> 24:03.010
that you would leave the Mystic Nine

24:04.270 --> 24:05.330
as long as I find Unit 401.

24:07.030 --> 24:07.620
Have you forgotten?

24:10.750 --> 24:12.180
Since you're not part of the Mystic Nine,

24:13.110 --> 24:14.290
then you are a commander,

24:14.920 --> 24:16.620
and I am a bandit.

24:18.070 --> 24:19.980
There's nothing we can talk about.

24:20.880 --> 24:21.420
See them off.

24:32.160 --> 24:33.180
You waited for me

24:34.270 --> 24:35.180
to come here.

24:36.790 --> 24:38.050
Even if I leave the Mystic Nine,

24:40.030 --> 24:41.090
we both know

24:42.550 --> 24:43.460
that

24:44.920 --> 24:46.380
we still need to sort things out in person.

24:48.550 --> 24:48.940
Okay.

24:50.440 --> 24:51.570
I'll allow that.

24:52.880 --> 24:54.490
I took over the Mystic Nine.

24:55.880 --> 24:56.900
We both

24:58.070 --> 24:59.330
have a score to settle.

25:05.790 --> 25:06.770
Wait for me here.

25:07.880 --> 25:08.420
Yes.

25:22.310 --> 25:23.130
We've been through

25:25.080 --> 25:26.490
so many things all these years.

25:27.830 --> 25:29.460
You think I don't know what you're doing?

25:30.240 --> 25:31.490
You went out of your way

25:32.480 --> 25:33.490
to usurp

25:33.760 --> 25:34.740
the other clans.

25:36.120 --> 25:37.300
You want people to think

25:38.040 --> 25:39.020
that you

25:39.400 --> 25:41.100
have taken over the Mystic Nine.

25:45.480 --> 25:46.530
What is your plan?

25:47.320 --> 25:48.780
I need to know everything.

25:51.510 --> 25:53.100
The truth is,

25:54.870 --> 25:56.250
other than you, everyone in the Mystic Nine

25:57.870 --> 25:59.020
has to die.

26:01.360 --> 26:02.210
Xie Jiu told you that?

26:04.630 --> 26:05.570
There was never

26:05.590 --> 26:06.570
a "kill six to save three" plan.

26:07.710 --> 26:09.100
It was all to convince Luo Ang.

26:09.910 --> 26:10.970
The real plan

26:11.720 --> 26:13.980
has always been to kill eight to save one.

26:15.350 --> 26:15.770
Master Zhang.

26:17.000 --> 26:18.250
You already know that,

26:19.440 --> 26:19.860
don't you?

26:30.310 --> 26:31.290
The Ministry of War

26:31.310 --> 26:32.420
will never spare those three clans.

26:33.590 --> 26:34.290
On the surface,

26:34.960 --> 26:36.730
they can spare the women and the opera performer.

26:37.310 --> 26:38.180
But in reality,

26:39.510 --> 26:40.290
they can

26:40.310 --> 26:41.380
just frame them for a crime

26:42.720 --> 26:43.900
and none of them will be spared.

26:44.680 --> 26:46.420
The pivotal information in this matter

26:47.550 --> 26:49.140
is that Luo Ang genuinely wants to save you.

26:50.720 --> 26:51.770
If you live,

26:53.240 --> 26:54.730
the Mystic Nine can live.

26:56.030 --> 26:56.900
Our followers

26:56.920 --> 26:57.900
who rely on us

26:57.920 --> 26:58.980
to fill their tummies can live.

27:01.350 --> 27:02.090
That's why

27:03.070 --> 27:04.530
I must help the Ministry of War

27:05.310 --> 27:07.180
eliminate the other masters

27:07.270 --> 27:08.280
in the Mystic Nine

27:08.280 --> 27:09.460
and take over the Mystic Nine myself.

27:11.750 --> 27:12.490
Then,

27:14.000 --> 27:15.090
the outcome is set in stone.

27:15.590 --> 27:16.490
This

27:17.030 --> 27:18.860
has always been my fight.

27:19.640 --> 27:21.020
I shouldn't have dragged all of you in.

27:21.070 --> 27:22.010
It's my fight.

27:22.070 --> 27:22.810
Not yours!

27:22.830 --> 27:23.530
By your fight,

27:23.550 --> 27:24.810
you mean to sacrifice yourself?

27:25.440 --> 27:25.730
Fine.

27:26.480 --> 27:27.490
So you're sacrificed.

27:27.590 --> 27:29.010
We can leave Changsha safely.

27:29.110 --> 27:30.330
Do you think we can survive?

27:30.440 --> 27:31.180
Do you think

27:31.240 --> 27:32.420
the Ministry of War will spare us?

27:36.200 --> 27:37.050
You still have time.

27:38.590 --> 27:39.730
If you leave now,

27:40.000 --> 27:41.010
you can still live.

27:41.200 --> 27:41.940
Master Zhang!

27:42.830 --> 27:44.050
Why can't you understand this?

27:45.480 --> 27:46.140
Xie Jiu,

27:46.440 --> 27:47.330
Xiaoyu, and I

27:47.640 --> 27:49.140
are trying to save you.

27:49.310 --> 27:50.290
It's not about your life.

27:50.440 --> 27:52.010
We are trying to save Changsha!

27:54.240 --> 27:55.180
You have a war to fight.

27:55.200 --> 27:56.530
You have to protect Changsha, Master Zhang.

27:58.270 --> 27:59.700
Time has changed.

28:00.480 --> 28:02.180
The Mystic Nine is no longer needed,

28:02.200 --> 28:02.860
Master Zhang.

28:08.680 --> 28:09.460
I

28:09.480 --> 28:10.660
finally come to this realization.

28:12.680 --> 28:13.860
The Monkey King is powerful,

28:16.070 --> 28:16.940
but he's still

28:16.960 --> 28:18.380
just a rabble-rousing monkey.

28:19.070 --> 28:20.290
He wreaks havoc in the Heavenly Palace,

28:20.400 --> 28:22.140
but he can't make a new one.

28:25.590 --> 28:26.570
But you can.

28:27.880 --> 28:28.900
You can set up new rules.

28:29.000 --> 28:29.940
You can protect our land

28:30.070 --> 28:31.140
and our people.

28:31.200 --> 28:32.770
So you must live!

28:41.160 --> 28:41.770
Kill me.

28:43.640 --> 28:45.380
Put an end to the whole Mystic Nine saga.

28:45.960 --> 28:47.420
Our people will live in peace.

28:54.200 --> 28:55.010
Kill me.

28:58.480 --> 28:59.010
No.

29:18.350 --> 29:19.330
If I

29:22.750 --> 29:24.330
hadn't dragged you into the Otherworld Tower,

29:25.790 --> 29:27.460
you would still have been the carefree Fifth Master.

29:29.000 --> 29:29.810
It's all

29:31.200 --> 29:32.180
my fault.

29:33.400 --> 29:34.530
I shouldn't have involved you.

29:40.440 --> 29:41.220
There's no turning back.

29:44.310 --> 29:45.770
Let me make the decision for you.

29:53.640 --> 29:55.220
Soon, the newspaper will say

29:56.830 --> 29:58.490
the head of the Mystic Nine, Wu Laogou,

29:59.920 --> 30:01.700
captured and killed the Defense Commander's

30:02.440 --> 30:03.660
Communication Officer.

30:04.550 --> 30:06.460
Then, he tried to assassinate the Defense Commander

30:06.550 --> 30:07.810
to start a riot.

30:09.200 --> 30:10.180
That crime

30:11.880 --> 30:13.220
is enough to have me killed thrice.

30:15.110 --> 30:15.810
Don't do that.

30:48.920 --> 30:49.770
He can cry.

30:50.790 --> 30:51.490
But why are you crying?

30:52.310 --> 30:53.140
Are you going to miss me?

31:02.720 --> 31:03.180
Bring it on.

31:04.350 --> 31:05.250
Forgive me.

31:12.580 --> 31:16.880
[Wu Laogou turned on his own and assassinated government officials]

31:16.880 --> 31:21.260
[Master Zhang captured the murderer to protect the city]

31:26.270 --> 31:26.860
Qishan.

31:27.510 --> 31:28.250
Well done.

31:30.000 --> 31:31.860
You are the reason why we could quell

31:32.160 --> 31:33.660
the riot of the Mystic Nine.

31:37.960 --> 31:40.330
I declare this case an attempt to incite a riot.

31:41.160 --> 31:42.140
The evidence is clear.

31:43.270 --> 31:44.140
According to the military order,

31:44.350 --> 31:45.380
he has to be publicly executed

31:45.640 --> 31:46.460
to serve as a warning to others.

31:47.920 --> 31:50.810
This will demonstrate our strict disciplines

31:51.880 --> 31:53.180
and reassure the people.

31:57.590 --> 31:58.490
Sign it.

31:59.440 --> 32:00.620
Carry out the execution

32:01.110 --> 32:02.220
tomorrow at the hour of Wu.

32:02.220 --> 32:05.220
[Judgment]

32:16.790 --> 32:17.980
I will supervise it personally

32:19.310 --> 32:20.460
to make sure nothing goes wrong.

32:22.500 --> 32:27.860
[Changsha Defense Commander Zhang Qishan]

32:30.740 --> 32:31.660
[Open Execution for Policy Correction]

32:42.660 --> 32:46.540
[Equality for People, Fair Administration]

33:58.680 --> 33:59.090
Master.

34:08.320 --> 34:09.490
Sorry, my friends.

34:11.230 --> 34:12.050
I dragged you into this.

34:12.840 --> 34:13.340
Master.

34:14.230 --> 34:15.460
What are you talking about?

34:16.840 --> 34:18.610
You gave us our lives.

34:18.880 --> 34:19.980
To die with you,

34:20.550 --> 34:21.130
it's worth it.

34:22.800 --> 34:24.210
With all of you next to me,

34:25.000 --> 34:26.460
my trip to the afterlife will be a lively one.

34:26.510 --> 34:27.780
Perhaps even the ghosts

34:28.320 --> 34:29.610
will be afraid of us.

34:29.670 --> 34:30.010
That's right.

34:30.480 --> 34:30.940
Master.

34:31.510 --> 34:32.690
You are the Monkey King.

34:33.760 --> 34:34.780
In the Underworld,

34:35.360 --> 34:36.860
we'll do something great together.

34:37.760 --> 34:38.900
We'll beat up the little imps,

34:39.670 --> 34:41.490
and fight our way back to the Heavenly Palace.

34:41.670 --> 34:42.380
That's right!

34:42.590 --> 34:43.380
Master!

34:43.480 --> 34:45.420
We will die with you!

34:51.670 --> 34:52.300
Good.

35:20.630 --> 35:22.010
Wu and his cohort of thugs

35:22.550 --> 35:23.570
possessed illegal arms,

35:23.840 --> 35:24.820
murdered government officials,

35:25.110 --> 35:26.090
and disrupted the societal peace.

35:26.490 --> 35:27.550
[Judgment]
They are found guilty of their crimes.

35:27.760 --> 35:30.170
In accordance with Section 16 of the Criminal Code of Armed Forces

35:30.710 --> 35:32.690
and Section 2 of the Bandits Regulations Ordinance,

35:33.320 --> 35:34.340
they will be sentenced to death

35:34.670 --> 35:35.650
immediately.

35:44.630 --> 35:45.900
Can I talk to him?

36:16.670 --> 36:17.260
Laogou.

36:20.710 --> 36:21.570
Any last words?

36:24.360 --> 36:25.900
I knew this day would come.

36:32.510 --> 36:34.170
I thought I could change my fate

36:36.550 --> 36:37.570
if you left the Mystic Nine.

36:41.000 --> 36:42.090
In the end,

36:43.670 --> 36:44.130
I still

36:46.480 --> 36:47.530
couldn't escape

36:47.550 --> 36:48.740
your control.

36:51.110 --> 36:52.210
Your shackles

36:53.480 --> 36:54.050
did not come from me,

36:56.360 --> 36:57.340
but you.

36:58.060 --> 37:01.460
♪Recognizing you through the smoke of war♪

37:04.590 --> 37:06.010
Can I ask for one last favor from you?

37:07.630 --> 37:08.900
That nobody

37:09.590 --> 37:10.780
has no right to take my life.

37:13.030 --> 37:14.090
We know each other so well.

37:16.320 --> 37:16.900
Master Zhang.

37:17.940 --> 37:21.100
♪You sit in your lone city while I protect my hometown♪

37:21.110 --> 37:21.900
Send me off.

37:22.900 --> 37:27.260
♪I dip my brush into the western wind to paint the setting sun♪

37:27.580 --> 37:31.940
♪The returning ravens are too noisy, how can I fight back?♪

37:32.860 --> 37:37.220
♪The land turns barren and old, the memories come flooding back♪

37:37.540 --> 37:42.380
♪Every moment with you appears in my heart♪

37:42.740 --> 37:47.340
♪My burning heart turns ashen, my hair turns white♪

37:47.780 --> 37:52.540
♪I look at you whilst I yearn for you♪

37:52.820 --> 37:57.220
♪The land is barren, the snow is thick, the longing is endless♪

37:57.580 --> 38:02.340
♪Thousand miles apart, with whom are you enjoying the good moments?♪

38:02.700 --> 38:07.300
♪It's just a dream, it's just my duty♪

38:07.660 --> 38:13.700
♪Trading my life for your safety♪

38:37.940 --> 38:41.180
♪Holding a pool of autumn water, we share the same robe♪

38:41.190 --> 38:41.900
Sir.

38:42.510 --> 38:44.300
Wu and his cohorts have been executed.

38:49.880 --> 38:50.780
From now on,

38:51.630 --> 38:53.300
hunt down the Mystic Nine.

38:54.070 --> 38:55.530
It shall not rise again.

38:57.780 --> 39:02.140
♪The land is barren, the snow is thick, the longing is endless♪

39:02.460 --> 39:07.300
♪Thousand miles apart, with whom are you enjoying the good moments?♪

39:07.660 --> 39:12.260
♪It's just a dream, it's just my duty♪

39:12.740 --> 39:17.740
♪Trading my life for your safety♪

39:17.760 --> 39:19.300
[20 Years Later]
My fellow audience,

39:19.440 --> 39:21.340
listen well.

39:21.590 --> 39:22.820
I shall tell you

39:23.920 --> 39:24.740
a story now.

39:25.800 --> 39:27.900
The tales of the martial arts world

39:28.030 --> 39:29.780
are like the moon.

39:30.030 --> 39:31.490
It's not full when you want it to be.

39:31.550 --> 39:33.780
It's crescent when you don't want it to be.

39:34.280 --> 39:35.010
As the saying goes,

39:35.550 --> 39:38.050
the raging tide of time

39:38.320 --> 39:40.460
will wash away different eras of heroes.

39:41.230 --> 39:42.170
Just like this,

39:42.880 --> 39:44.490
the prestigious Mystic Nine

39:44.710 --> 39:46.820
that once settled in here

39:47.400 --> 39:48.380
is now left

39:48.440 --> 39:50.460
without even a plaque.

39:50.800 --> 39:52.690
Some say that they were bandits.

39:52.840 --> 39:53.740
Some say

39:53.920 --> 39:56.530
they were protectors of the people.

39:57.110 --> 39:58.820
Are they good or evil,

39:58.880 --> 39:59.780
a boon or a bane?

39:59.840 --> 40:01.650
No one knows.

40:02.110 --> 40:04.170
It really shows us

40:04.630 --> 40:06.090
that as grand as the martial arts world can be,

40:06.360 --> 40:10.940
no one can survive the changing of time.

40:13.880 --> 40:15.130
So what happened to Master Zhang?

40:15.280 --> 40:16.530
Where did he go?

40:16.840 --> 40:17.740
I grew up here,

40:17.800 --> 40:18.650
and I've never

40:18.710 --> 40:20.130
heard of a person called Master Zhang.

40:21.480 --> 40:22.490
And Wu Laogou

40:22.590 --> 40:24.170
died just like that?

40:24.440 --> 40:25.420
And Chen Pi

40:25.510 --> 40:26.940
is blind.

40:27.030 --> 40:28.610
How is he going to fight now?

40:29.480 --> 40:30.530
And Huo Xiangu,

40:30.760 --> 40:31.940
is anyone taking care of her?

40:32.150 --> 40:33.650
She's a prideful woman.

40:33.880 --> 40:35.570
She won't just lie on the bed all her life.

40:35.840 --> 40:36.860
And what about Qi Tiezui?

40:37.110 --> 40:38.740
Isn't he a seer?

40:38.960 --> 40:40.570
He didn't predict the bad outcome?

40:43.840 --> 40:45.050
All right. All right.

40:45.400 --> 40:47.900
You sure have a lot of questions.

40:48.230 --> 40:49.980
But there are certain things

40:50.440 --> 40:51.650
in this world

40:51.800 --> 40:53.740
that have no answer.

40:53.960 --> 40:54.940
Some of them

40:55.320 --> 40:57.300
become legends.

40:57.710 --> 40:58.490
That's all I know

40:58.510 --> 40:59.820
about the Mystic Nine.

41:00.230 --> 41:02.090
As to what happens later,

41:02.400 --> 41:05.010
I have no idea.

41:05.880 --> 41:06.260
Anyway,

41:06.630 --> 41:07.260
look.

41:07.480 --> 41:08.780
It's getting late.

41:08.920 --> 41:10.380
Go back home and eat.

41:10.590 --> 41:11.940
If you want more stories,

41:12.110 --> 41:14.490
come here again tomorrow.

41:14.510 --> 41:15.300
All right.

41:26.880 --> 41:28.130
They already went back.

41:28.280 --> 41:29.610
Why are you still here?

41:30.030 --> 41:31.530
I don't like this story.

41:32.030 --> 41:33.010
The Mystic Nine

41:33.030 --> 41:34.300
shouldn't end like this.

41:35.400 --> 41:36.050
Sir,

41:36.920 --> 41:38.050
are you telling

41:38.760 --> 41:39.780
a true story,

41:40.070 --> 41:41.610
or did you make it up?

41:42.440 --> 41:43.740
If you made it up,

41:44.840 --> 41:45.780
can you...

41:46.190 --> 41:47.490
Can you change the ending?

41:47.710 --> 41:49.050
Let them live.

41:49.360 --> 41:50.690
Master Zhang won't leave.

41:50.880 --> 41:52.170
Wu Laogou won't die.

41:52.480 --> 41:53.690
They drink and eat

41:53.760 --> 41:54.740
together,

41:54.880 --> 41:56.050
and have a good time.

42:15.940 --> 42:20.100
♪The past fades like smoke♪

42:20.460 --> 42:23.180
♪A choice is made in silence♪

42:23.460 --> 42:26.260
♪In this labyrinthine puzzle♪

42:26.660 --> 42:30.420
♪Who can reach the shore?♪

42:30.660 --> 42:34.100
♪Just an ordinary farewell♪

42:34.380 --> 42:37.780
♪The sun seems to shine bright over our heads♪

42:37.860 --> 42:45.140
♪But this could be our last trip together♪

42:45.580 --> 42:48.860
♪The spring breeze continues outside♪

42:49.140 --> 42:52.380
♪Who was it who left in such haste?♪

42:52.540 --> 42:56.580
♪Caught in the game, the raging waves fall silent♪

42:56.780 --> 43:00.140
♪Who believes in fate?♪

43:00.380 --> 43:03.740
♪For my home and my country, the years pass like a dream♪

43:03.980 --> 43:07.260
♪When the song ends, who will still be waiting?♪

43:07.580 --> 43:11.260
♪With a nod, we bid farewell and set out again♪

43:11.460 --> 43:14.700
♪Take care♪

43:14.700 --> 43:17.260
♪We once raced♪

43:17.340 --> 43:19.260
♪For the dawn♪

43:19.420 --> 43:22.700
♪Ever-lasting bond, a satisfying vindication♪

43:22.820 --> 43:26.100
♪In the web of fate♪

43:26.100 --> 43:29.300
♪No one can escape♪

43:30.300 --> 43:32.140
♪Life and death cut like a blade♪

43:32.300 --> 43:33.860
♪We too were young once♪

43:33.940 --> 43:37.380
♪Fortunate to brave the raging waves together♪

43:37.580 --> 43:39.900
♪Keep the ember lit♪

43:40.020 --> 43:44.540
♪To illuminate the journey ahead♪

43:44.660 --> 43:47.620
♪The spring breeze continues outside♪

43:47.860 --> 43:51.380
♪Who was it who left in such haste?♪

43:51.500 --> 43:55.260
♪Caught in the game, the raging waves fall silent♪

43:55.580 --> 43:59.060
♪Who believes in fate?♪

43:59.220 --> 44:02.220
♪For my home and my country, the years pass like a dream♪

44:02.460 --> 44:06.220
♪When the song ends, who will still be waiting?♪

44:06.380 --> 44:10.100
♪With a nod, we bid farewell and set out again♪

44:10.220 --> 44:21.660
♪Please, do take care of yourself♪
